        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "I have all the information needed. This is a single problem (a double integral over a diamond region). Let me solve it.\n\n**Problem:** Compute $\\iint_D e^{\\frac{|y|}{|x|+|y|}}\\,d\\sigma$ where $D=\\{(x,y): |x|+|y|\\le 1\\}$.\n\n**Solution:** The integrand depends only on the ratio $|y|/(|x|+|y|)$, and the region is symmetric under all reflections $x\\to -x$, $y\\to -y$. So integrate over the first quadrant and multiply by 4.\n\nIn the first quadrant, $D_1 = \\{x\\ge 0, y\\ge 0, x+y\\le 1\\}$. Use $u = x+y$, $v = \\frac{y}{x+y}$ (so $v\\in[0,1]$). The Jacobian: $x = u(1-v)$, $y = uv$, so $|J| = u$. Then\n\n$$\\iint_{D_1} e^{y/(x+y)}\\,dx\\,dy = \\int_0^1\\int_0^1 e^{v}\\, u\\, dv\\, du = \\left(\\int_0^1 u\\,du\\right)\\left(\\int_0^1 e^v\\,dv\\right) = \\frac12(e-1).$$\n\nMultiply by 4: total $= 2(e-1)$.",
        "tool_calls": [
          {
            "id": "call_bef938f9ab6f447fbc85e623",
            "index": 0,
            "type": "function",
            "function": {
              "name": "submit_solution",
              "arguments": "{\"region_id\": \"region_art_0005_01\", \"final_answer\": \"$$\\\\iint_D e^{\\\\frac{|y|}{|x|+|y|}}\\\\,d\\\\sigma = 2(e-1)$$\", \"reasoning\": \"题目：设平面区域 D={(x,y): |x|+|y|≤1}，求 ∬_D e^{|y|/(|x|+|y|)} dσ。\\n\\n【图形作用与已知关系】区域 D 是以 (1,0),(0,1),(-1,0),(0,-1) 为顶点的菱形（正方形旋转45°），关于 x 轴、y 轴及原点均对称。被积函数 f(x,y)=e^{|y|/(|x|+|y|)} 只依赖于 |x|、|y|，因此关于两条坐标轴都是偶函数。利用对称性，只需在第一象限 D₁={x≥0, y≥0, x+y≤1} 上积分，再乘以 4。\\n\\n【换元】在 D₁ 上 |x|=x, |y|=y，被积函数为 e^{y/(x+y)}。作变换\\n  u = x+y,  v = y/(x+y),\\n则 x = u(1-v), y = uv，其中 (u,v)∈[0,1]×[0,1]。\\n雅可比行列式 J = ∂(x,y)/∂(u,v) = | 1-v  -u ; v  u | = u(1-v)+uv = u，故 dxdy = u dudv。\\n\\n【计算】∬_{D₁} e^{y/(x+y)} dxdy = ∫₀¹∫₀¹ e^v · u dv du = (∫₀¹ u du)(∫₀¹ e^v dv) = (1/2)(e-1)。\\n\\n【结论】由对称性，原积分 = 4 × (1/2)(e-1) = 2(e-1)。\\n\\n【知识点】二重积分的对称性（奇偶性）化简、二重积分换元法（雅可比行列式）、含绝对值区域的积分处理。\"}"
